Changes in this project: scope filtering, structured command conversion,
Japanese normal-move labels, frame-value status classification, exclusion and
collision audits, source-record-bound review annotations, exact-duplicate
merging, restoration of explicit knockdown markers as D, restoration of
explicit not-applicable dashes, quality reports and before/after diffs.
Data remains patch-unverified; see archive/docs/FRAME_DATA_QUALITY_REPORT.md.

